heir warring worlds before an even greater threat endangers them all.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1371727,\"title\":\"Sing: Thriller\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g0PZr8TYqIhSWq1EPmTisIqfr0K.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Rhs8yzMTtAcOUvJXqUg7kzljb7.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Buster Moon dreams up a star-studded spectacle set to Michael Jackson's \\\"Thriller\\\" in this animated short featuring characters from the hit \\\"Sing\\\" films.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":302429,\"title\":\"Strange Magic\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vjCdrK8gGRFnyuZb1j9BzgN2RaY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aUbyQhWcPS7S0Su2d9Tgk3NxdPk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A love potion works its devious charms on fairies, elves and the swamp-dwelling Bog King as they all try to possess the potion for themselves.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Animation\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":622855,\"title\":\"Jingle Jangle: A Christmas Journey\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5RbyHIVydD3Krmec1LlUV7rRjet.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6C7ZGYeR8QpT3X6C2RFEu6yiSKK.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An imaginary world comes to life in a holiday tale of an eccentric toymaker, his adventurous granddaughter, and a magical invention that has the power to change their lives forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":818110,\"title\":\"The Magic Flute\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AeIKugiQy1e3RZTrwXH1a84D8eo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8tRDmaAXSoX1l57PvtUdd0byxWC.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A seventeen year old travels from London to the Austrian Alps to attend the legendary Mozart boarding school. There, he discovers a centuries-old forgotten passageway into the fantastic world of Mozart's \\\"The Magic Flute\\\".\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":201676,\"title\":\"My Little Pony: Equestria Girls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3tQM3PUDn9i2iq0HP7yLlQsQ0ya.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sCCv0SGBFygz9CJYHuz012a0vHz.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Via a magic mirror, Twilight Sparkle travels into an alternate universe in order to recover a crown that was stolen from the Crystal Empire. Upon her arrival she is horrified to learn that she has turned into a human.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":177888,\"title\":\"Teen Beach Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sKrGe5EmDSyVaWM0uj7rJDQHRjB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uKoJTTgpyWiu04hzSgPWbyJfjYi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Life's a beach for surfers Brady and McKenzie – until a rogue wave magically transports them inside the classic '60s beach party flick, \\\"Wet Side Story,\\\" where a full-blown rivalry between bikers and surfers threatens to erupt. There, amidst a sea of surfing, singing and dancing, Brady and Mack accidentally change the storyline, and the film’s dreamy hero and heroine fall for them instead of for each other!\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Music\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":478907,\"title\":\"The Nutcracker\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qF0Fc16zEJuQdA81RZLWhvHJ4mK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kRBgVX2AzNAMtA86rhdhedBN3LY.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The young Clara creeps downstairs on Christmas Eve to play with her favourite present – a Nutcracker. But the mysterious magician Drosselmeyer is wa